Package: sonic-supervisord-utilities-rs
Source: sonic
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SONiC Team <sonic-dev@lists.sonicfoundation.dev>
Installed-Size: 824
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), libswsscommon (>= 1.0.0)
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: SONiC supervisor process exit listener in Rust
 Rust implementation of SONiC supervisord utilities that provides process
 monitoring and alerting functionality for SONiC containers. This is a
 performance-focused port of the original Python sonic-supervisord-utilities
 package.
